  3.930732996229354*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"dcddfc5a-0c3b-4c7c-928e-\
20141bd79767"],

Cell["\<\
Options:
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Asymptote\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Bool (Default: \
True): Show Asymptotes - large impact on speed
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]N\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Bool: (Default: False): \
Calculate features using numeric approximation - use for difficult equations \
and to increase speed
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]TP\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Bool (Default: True): \
Show stationary points (stationary point of inflection/local minima/local \
maxima) - small impact on speed
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IP\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Bool (Default: True): \
Show Inflection Points (Non stationary) - small impact on speed
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]EndPoints\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Bool (Default: \
True): Show endpoints of graph - small impact on speed
PlotPoints ->Int (Default: 50): More PlotPoints makes graph less fuzzy at the \
cost of speed
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Time\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> Int (Default: 7): \
Maximum allowed computation time before forcing abort - Increase for \
difficult equations
Example: Betterplot[{y + x == x^2 + Tan[x], 5 - x/2 == y}, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Asymptote\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> True, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]N\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> False, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]TP\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> True, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Time\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> 7, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]IP\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> True, \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Endpoints\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] -> True, PlotPoints \
-> 50]\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9624974904435873`*^9, 3.962497538370637*^9}, {
   3.962497574089554*^9, 3.962497805684486*^9}, {3.9624978405439053`*^9, 
   3.962497854242865*^9}, {3.962497960096643*^9, 3.962497996828909*^9}, {
   3.962498038653825*^9, 3.962498348775201*^9}, {3.962498400564148*^9, 
   3.962498445175511*^9}, {3.962498479167824*^9, 3.9624986482047033`*^9}, 
   3.962499358963593*^9, {3.96249988597193*^9, 
   3.9624998872373877`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1d0954f1-dc69-471f-bd75-\
b6fc7d96318f"],

